  "routeAdjustment": "Restrict the existing all-index commuting family to the nonzero prescribed good-prime eigenspace, then reuse the existing common-eigenvector theorem. Reuse actual cusp coefficient linearity, injectivity and the first-coefficient Hecke formula. This gives the precise required normalized cusp eigensystem without the external proof of a second full Hecke algebra, maximal ideal or annihilator theorem.",
